 on that one.␀Task cleared. Write it in the log.␀␀{n} quests finished. I am keeping score.␀␀␀␀Beat that. I dare you.␀␀Best of {n}. That is my record and I am keeping it.␀We do not talk about that round.␀␀␀␀You were gone {n} days. I counted every one.␀␀␀␀Radios coming back up. Give me a second.␀␀␀␀Something changed. I can feel the new antenna.␀␀I am the whole watch now. Go on, sleep.␀PASS␀␀␀␀WARN␀␀␀␀SKIP␀␀␀␀????␀␀␀␀[HWTest] Display: PASS␀␀/sd␀[HWTest] SD Card: FAIL (init failed)␀␀␀␀[HWTest] SD Card: FAIL (no card)␀␀␀␀[HWTest] SD Card: PASS (%lluMB)
